WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.407
One player. One screen. Pretty normal so far.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.816
Four mates? Split it four ways.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.186
Sixteen? Yeah, still going.

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:17.690
Sixty-four drivers. One shared screen. And there's no player cap.

00:00:20.317 --> 00:00:23.053
This is Joystick Jammers. Bring the whole mob.

00:00:23.803 --> 00:00:27.980
Every track is generated fresh. Dirt, bitumen, town streets, and rocky country.

00:00:30.553 --> 00:00:33.530
And then someone put a loop in the road. Completely reasonable.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:40.540
Take the Cruz Missile, the A U Hawk, the Tradie Ute, or the Lion President.

00:00:42.603 --> 00:00:46.460
Or stir things up with the Pig Catcher, the Postie Bike, and the Hawk Dash.

00:00:48.003 --> 00:00:52.340
Your phone is the controller. Or bring a keyboard or a gamepad. Get everyone in.

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:57.210
Joystick Jammers. Bring everyone. Play in your browser.
